WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.440
Tesla is asking Texas for tax relief on a $3.1 billion polysilicon plant that would create 515 jobs by

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:15.560
2032. This is Tesla Shorts Time, episode 670. Cybercab registrations in Texas and a production

00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:21.500
pledge in Shanghai follow, then first principles on energy margins. Newasis County is where

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:28.660
Tesla wants the plant. KRIS-6 News in Corpus Christi reports, inside the Tuloso Midway School District.

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:33.240
The company applied under a state program that would waive day-to-day school property

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:39.860
taxes from 2028 to 2030 and have them from 2031 to 2040.

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:45.700
Even with the break, the district would still collect about $222 million in taxes from

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:49.260
the plant between 2028 and 2065.

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:56.200
Average compensation plus benefits would be $130,000 and the site would sit along State Highway

00:00:56.200 --> 00:01:05.340
44 between FM 1,694 and county road 61, with construction running from 2027 to 2030.

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:11.140
Tesla says more than 90% of the world's solar-grade polysilicon is currently made in China.

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:16.060
The school board has been under a non-disclosure agreement with Tesla for about six months,

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:21.300
but has not yet approved any break, and the Comptroller's Office will review the application

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:25.220
and make a recommendation before the school board and the governor's office decide.

00:01:25.220 --> 00:01:31.266
Texas logged a record 200 cybercabs on its automated vehicle register in a single-day

00:01:31.266 --> 00:01:36.926
Tesla Roddy notes plus one model Y. The additions pushed Tesla's cybercab

00:01:36.926 --> 00:01:42.026
count past 750 registered units in the state. Tesla restored its lead over

00:01:42.026 --> 00:01:49.586
Waymo with 1,507 driverless vehicles against Waymo's 1,321. Cybercabs now make

00:01:49.586 --> 00:01:58.566
up 51.3% of Tesla's registered Texas fleet at 773 units versus 734 model-wise. The timing

00:01:58.566 --> 00:02:03.966
aligns with Tesla's stated plans to launch in Dallas next month, and Model Y Robo Taxis

00:02:03.966 --> 00:02:09.226
have already run without drivers around the clock in Dallas since November 11. Tesla is

00:02:09.226 --> 00:02:14.346
shifting factory capacity toward the CyberCab, including winding down CyberTruck production

00:02:14.346 --> 00:02:21.204
at Giga, Texas by the end of summer 2027. Elon Musk said in remarks Reuters carried from his

00:02:21.204 --> 00:02:26.084
first public visit to Shenzhen. The Tesla will continue to increase production in China.

00:02:26.664 --> 00:02:34.024
The Shanghai factory delivered 810,889 Model 3 and Model Y vehicles in the first 10 months of the year,

00:02:34.544 --> 00:02:41.464
up 21.4% year on year. 98% of components were sourced locally. The plant has an annual

00:02:41.464 --> 00:02:47.024
capacity of more than 950,000 vehicles and supplies the Chinese market as well as exports

00:02:47.024 --> 00:02:52.804
to Europe, South Korea and Australia. Musk described himself as a superfan of China,

00:02:53.424 --> 00:02:58.264
praised its architecture, natural landscapes, and railway system, and noted that greater

00:02:58.264 --> 00:03:04.264
cooperation between the US and China would benefit both countries. Domestic retail sales in China

00:03:04.264 --> 00:03:12.424
totaled 389,905 vehicles in the first 10 months, down 15% year-on-year, while exports reached

00:03:12.424 --> 00:03:22.101
420,984 vehicles, up 101.28%. When Tesla owns the cell chemistry and the final assembly steps,

00:03:22.581 --> 00:03:27.201
energy storage gross margin can move with material prices and factory utilization,

00:03:27.801 --> 00:03:34.281
rather than with third-party supplier contracts. The 33.1% energy gross margin reported for the

00:03:34.281 --> 00:03:39.781
third quarter already reflects some of that leverage. High local content inside one country cuts

00:03:39.781 --> 00:03:45.381
logistics cost and tariff exposure. It also concentrates supply risk if trade rules shift.

00:03:46.061 --> 00:03:51.081
That same local content model can support home market sales and export volume when the factory

00:03:51.081 --> 00:03:56.681
is large enough to serve both. One production base then balances two markets without a second set

00:03:56.681 --> 00:04:01.781
of suppliers. Building the front end of the solar supply chain inside the United States changes

00:04:01.781 --> 00:04:06.761
the cost structure for Tesla Energy products. It shortens the distance between raw material

00:04:06.761 --> 00:04:12.341
and a finished Megapack or Powerwall. Input price stability for solar cells is the industrial

00:04:12.341 --> 00:04:18.321
point of making that feedstock at home. Megapack and Powerwall margins then stop being a pass-through

00:04:18.321 --> 00:04:24.361
of someone else's polysilicon contract. Factor utilization becomes the lever because the material

00:04:24.361 --> 00:04:29.821
and the finished cabinet sit in the same cost stack. Yield is the other lever because a plant that

00:04:29.821 --> 00:04:33.621
that Mrs. Quality simply recreates the import bill it was meant to replace.

00:04:34.161 --> 00:04:39.381
Future margin expansion on storage then depends on whether a single large industrial project,

00:04:39.601 --> 00:04:42.681
whose tax treatment is still under review, actually works.

00:04:43.321 --> 00:04:48.841
Extending the same logic to Polysilicon adds another controllable input price, instead of leaving

00:04:48.841 --> 00:04:51.301
solar-grade feedstock to overseas contracts.

00:04:52.001 --> 00:04:53.161
None of that is automatic.

00:04:53.521 --> 00:04:56.881
It depends on the facility reaching the scale the application describes.

00:04:56.881 --> 00:05:01.601
tribes. Trade rules can still move, which is why a second source of solar-grade silicon

00:05:01.601 --> 00:05:07.101
is a hedge as well as a cost play. The project would also create a new revenue and employment

00:05:07.101 --> 00:05:13.179
anchor, with long-term school tax collections continuing even after temporary relief. An

00:05:13.179 --> 00:05:17.959
autonomous model why, without a steering wheel or pedals, is planned to handle the 10% of

00:05:17.959 --> 00:05:23.059
rider miles that need more than two seats. Elon Musk said at the New York Times dealbook

00:05:23.059 --> 00:05:25.459
summit in an account inside EVs carried.

00:05:26.019 --> 00:05:30.279
The vehicle would carry six or seven people and complement the two-seat cybercab.

00:05:30.599 --> 00:05:36.779
Musk noted that the cybercab covers 90% of passenger miles, leaving the rest for multi-passenger

00:05:36.779 --> 00:05:38.279
trips such as family travel.

00:05:38.859 --> 00:05:43.459
The new variant would be designed from the factory without basic driving control, so passengers

00:05:43.459 --> 00:05:44.219
only ride.

00:05:44.859 --> 00:05:48.379
Regular model-wise with steering wheels will remain available for purchase.

00:05:48.379 --> 00:05:54.219
Tessla already operates model-wise in its Robotaxi fleet, but those retain steering wheels

00:05:54.219 --> 00:05:54.779
and pedals.

00:05:56.107 --> 00:06:00.677
Optimus is slated for an interactive video within two months that will emphasize authenticity.

00:06:01.377 --> 00:06:03.697
Elon Musk said in comments, futon carried.

00:06:04.237 --> 00:06:09.697
The robot is expected to handle the full dirty plate sequence of scraping food, washing, drying,

00:06:10.037 --> 00:06:12.757
and putting items away safely in 12 to 18 months.

00:06:13.397 --> 00:06:15.637
No current humanoid can perform that sequence.

00:06:16.317 --> 00:06:18.137
Hands remain the primary bottleneck.

00:06:18.137 --> 00:06:26.157
The first real-world work is targeted at heavy industries such as mining and refining on a 24-7 basis, with home use coming later.

00:06:26.697 --> 00:06:30.637
Musk stated that everyone will eventually want one or two optimist units.

00:06:31.556 --> 00:06:41.096
A judge ordered the canoe government, CBC reports, to disclose who decided to exclude Tesla from Manitoba's electric vehicle, or EV, rebate program, and why.

00:06:41.676 --> 00:06:45.116
The ruling requires the province to release the relevant affidavits.

00:06:45.116 --> 00:06:50.636
Tesla had been barred from the program despite meeting the technical criteria for eligible vehicles.

00:06:51.523 --> 00:06:54.823
Powerwall owners are dispatching power to stabilize the grid.

00:06:55.463 --> 00:07:01.463
Tesla Energy said, through more than 100 Tesla Virtual Power Plant or VPP programs worldwide.

00:07:02.003 --> 00:07:06.763
The systems activate automatically and quietly during outages without homeowners noticing

00:07:06.763 --> 00:07:07.403
the switch.

00:07:08.311 --> 00:07:15.371
Vehicle touch screens in the latest software update, 2026.44.1, now cluster charger pins

00:07:15.371 --> 00:07:18.151
on the map to show network coverage when zooming out.

00:07:18.511 --> 00:07:20.611
The Tesla charging account on X noted.

00:07:21.051 --> 00:07:23.771
The same update adds third-party chargers in Europe.

00:07:24.351 --> 00:07:26.771
The change improves visibility of charging options

00:07:26.771 --> 00:07:27.911
at different zoom levels.

00:07:28.949 --> 00:07:32.309
Tesla opened its first dedicated semi-megacharger in Texas,

00:07:32.929 --> 00:07:35.609
digital today reports, though the annual target

00:07:35.609 --> 00:07:37.409
of 37 sites remains in doubt.

00:07:38.049 --> 00:07:40.569
The site supports the growing semi-fleet operating

00:07:40.569 --> 00:07:41.149
in the state.

00:07:42.111 --> 00:07:44.931
The Tesla iPhone app now uses Google Maps instead

00:07:44.931 --> 00:07:51.891
of Apple Maps in version 4.63.0, drive Tesla Canada notes. The version adds a new look,

00:07:52.151 --> 00:07:57.131
summon satellite views, and smoother sight maps. The change affects navigation and location

00:07:57.131 --> 00:08:03.749
features within the Tesla app on iOS. Tesla posted a video showing more than 50 cybercabs parked

00:08:03.749 --> 00:08:09.669
in a Dallas lot, with additional units arriving on a car carrier. The footage suggests preparation for

00:08:09.669 --> 00:08:15.069
an upcoming launch in the city. Canadian officials are reviewing whether to restrict Chinese-made electric

00:08:15.069 --> 00:08:18.529
vehicles from certain roads and areas due to data security risks.

00:08:18.949 --> 00:08:23.529
The review follows broader concerns about data collection and transmission features in vehicles

00:08:23.529 --> 00:08:30.168
from China. Elsewhere, Tesla announced in a report auto-evolution carried, plans for a 3 billion

00:08:30.168 --> 00:08:35.288
euro expansion at Gigaburlin that includes a new building capable of producing up to 1 million

00:08:35.288 --> 00:08:41.448
cybercabs annually starting in 2029. PowerCore in Transformer Magazine's account

00:08:41.448 --> 00:08:48.508
Integrates transformer, inverter and breaker functions on a 9-megavolt ampere, or MVA solid-state

00:08:48.508 --> 00:08:57.031
platform with 98.86% peak efficiency and first operation planned for 2027. A series of fatal

00:08:57.031 --> 00:09:03.851
crashes involving Tesla vehicles with autopilot or full self-driving or FSD engaged have resurfaced

00:09:03.851 --> 00:09:10.411
in headlines, electric reports. One case involved a Model Y that crossed a median at 74 miles per

00:09:10.411 --> 00:09:16.091
hour. Another hit an overturned truck at 71 miles per hour. The incidents follow familiar

00:09:16.091 --> 00:09:20.431
patterns of vehicles striking fixed objects or other vehicles under similar conditions.

00:09:21.563 --> 00:09:26.663
Elon Musk posted that the goal is to extend consciousness to the stars. He noted that star

00:09:26.663 --> 00:09:32.123
link began with a speech delivered in Seattle. Musk said a decoder ring is needed to figure out which

00:09:32.123 --> 00:09:38.863
artificial intelligence or AI model to use for what purpose. He also stated that all text conversations

00:09:38.863 --> 00:09:41.563
are moving to encryption to ensure user privacy.

00:09:42.143 --> 00:09:44.683
Before we go, next month's plan Dallas launch

00:09:44.683 --> 00:09:46.983
is the date those new Texas registrations

00:09:46.983 --> 00:09:48.383
are already lining up against.

